1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:02,450
(Penny:)It was fine.

2
00:00:02,616 --> 00:00:04,116
(Leonard:)Come on, this is silly.

3
00:00:04,284 --> 00:00:08,594
Hey, I brought you back
a little present from my trip, huh?

4
00:00:10,557 --> 00:00:13,537
(Leonard:)It's that sailor cap that you wanted.
it's neat, huh?

5
00:00:15,195 --> 00:00:18,805
(Sheldon:)You honestly think you can buy back
my friendship with a cheap souvenir?

6
00:00:19,967 --> 00:00:23,107
I don'I. No, I really don't.
Just try it on.

7
00:00:27,941 --> 00:00:28,941
(Stuart:)-Oh, yeah.
-Hello, sailor.

8
00:00:29,109 --> 00:00:30,949
(Penny:)Now we're talking.

9
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:34,280
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

10
00:00:43,056 --> 00:00:44,896
(Sheldon:)This changes nothing.

11
00:00:46,093 --> 00:00:48,333
(Sheldon:)Except the Halloween costume
I'm wearing this year.

12
00:00:49,763 --> 00:00:52,833
(Sheldon:)Amy, you're going to be Olive Oyl.
Lay off the doughnuts.

13
00:00:57,604 --> 00:00:59,674
(Howard:)-Thanks for coming over.
-No problem.

14
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,150
Ooh! You made little sandwiches!

